"The Hot Lab Coat is a Wardrobe item worth about a million dollars."
"It is a long, shiny red leather hooded trench coat with goggles."
"It gives +1 Dexterity, +1 Agility and Blast Resistance against heat and explosive force."
"Wearing it makes a Rabbit eligible for lab work on the Triplanets."
"Worli Ro-den sat on the committee that put it in the Wardrobe decades ago."
"Hot labs on the Triplanets make magical bombs."
"It is waterproof, and its deep hood tucks into a neck panel."
"Demon bug strikes on it leave only small melted spots and puffs of ash."
